{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "QMOS — Qurilish Monitoringi Ochiq Standarti",
    "version": "1.0",
    "summary": "Qurilish obyektlari haqidagi jonli ma'lumotni markaziy monitoring tizimiga yuborish standarti.",
    "description": "Pudratchi tashkilotlar foydalanadigan istalgan dastur (ERP, hisob tizimi)\nobyektlari haqidagi ma'lumotni shu standart bo'yicha markaziy monitoring\ntizimiga yuboradi. Markaz ma'lumotni **qabul qiladi, tekshiradi va\no'zgarmas holda saqlaydi**; viloyat va tuman bo'yicha ko'rinish SOATO\nkodlaridan yig'iladi.\n\n## Asosiy qoidalar\n\n* **Faqat yuborish (push).** Markaz tashkilot tizimiga hech qachon\n  murojaat qilmaydi. Tashkilot nima yuborilishini to'liq nazorat qiladi.\n* **Ma'lumotni minimallashtirish.** Moliya, ish haqi, narxlar va\n  ishchilarning shaxsiy ma'lumotlari yuborilMAYDI. Standartda ular uchun\n  maydon yo'q — sxema ortiqcha maydonni rad etadi.\n* **O'zgarmaslik.** Qabul qilingan hodisa o'zgartirilmaydi va\n  o'chirilmaydi. Tuzatish — yangi hodisa, `supersedes` bilan.\n* **Idempotentlik.** Bir xil `event_id` qayta yuborilsa `duplicate`\n  qaytadi va hech narsa o'zgarmaydi. Shu sabab tarmoq uzilganda qayta\n  yuborish xavfsiz. Bir xil `event_id` boshqa mazmun bilan kelsa —\n  `conflict`.\n* **Tartib.** Obyekt avval `site.profile` bilan ro'yxatga olinadi.\n  Boshqa hodisalar `occurred_at` bo'yicha tartiblanadi; kechikib kelgan\n  hodisa ham qabul qilinadi.\n\n## Autentifikatsiya (HMAC imzo)\n\nHar bir tashkilotga markaz `key_id` va maxfiy `secret` beradi. Har bir\nso'rovda uchta sarlavha yuboriladi:\n\n| Sarlavha | Qiymati |\n|---|---|\n| `X-QMOS-Key-Id` | kalit identifikatori |\n| `X-QMOS-Timestamp` | Unix vaqti, soniya |\n| `X-QMOS-Signature` | `hex(HMAC-SHA256(secret, imzo_satri))` |\n\n`imzo_satri = timestamp + \"\\n\" + METHOD + \"\\n\" + path + \"\\n\" + hex(SHA256(tana))`\n\nMarkaz vaqti bilan farq 300 soniyadan oshsa so'rov rad etiladi\n(qayta yuborish hujumidan himoya). Vaqtni tekshirish uchun `GET /v1/ping`.\nPython'da tayyor funksiya: `qmos.sign_request()`.\n\n## Versiyalash\n\n`1.x` ichida faqat **ixtiyoriy** maydon va yangi hodisa turi qo'shiladi —\neski yuboruvchilar buzilmaydi. Majburiy maydon qo'shish, maydonni olib\ntashlash yoki ma'nosini o'zgartirish — faqat `2.0` da, yangi `/v2/` yo'li\nbilan; `/v1/` kamida 12 oy parallel ishlaydi.\n",
    "license": {
      "name": "CC BY 4.0",
      "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
    }
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://{host}",
      "variables": {
        "host": {
          "default": "markaz.example.uz",
          "description": "Markaziy monitoring tizimi manzili (pilot paytida belgilanadi)."
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "qmosKeyId": [],
      "qmosTimestamp": [],
      "qmosSignature": []
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Hodisalar"
    },
    {
      "name": "Fayllar"
    },
    {
      "name": "Xizmat"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/v1/events": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Hodisalar"
        ],
        "operationId": "postEvents",
        "summary": "Hodisalar to'plamini yuborish",
        "description": "Bir so'rovda 1–500 ta hodisa. Har biri alohida tekshiriladi; javobdagi\n`results` so'rov tartibida. HTTP 200 — to'plam qayta ishlandi (ichida\nrad etilganlari bo'lishi mumkin).\n",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Batch"
              },
              "example": {
                "events": [
                  {
                    "spec_version": "1.0",
                    "event_id": "01928f3a-0000-7a00-8000-000000000001",
                    "event_type": "site.profile",
                    "occurred_at": "2026-10-01T09:00:00+05:00",
                    "source": {
                      "system": "buildops",
                      "system_version": "2.0.10"
                    },
                    "organization": {
                      "stir": "305123456"
                    },
                    "site_id": "obyekt-17",
                    "data": {
                      "name": "Namuna tumani, 4-sonli maktabni qayta qurish",
                      "category": "building_public",
                      "address": {
                        "region_soato": "1710",
                        "district_soato": "1710233",
                        "text": "Mustaqillik MFY, Navro'z ko'chasi 12"
                      },
                      "location": {
                        "center": {
                          "lat": 39.0347,
                          "lng": 66.5722
                        },
                        "radius_m": 250
                      },
                      "permit": {
                        "number": "QR-2026-004512",
                        "issued_on": "2026-08-20"
                      },
                      "customer": {
                        "name": "Namuna tumani hokimligi",
                        "stir": "201234567"
                      },
                      "funding_source": "local_budget",
                      "planned_start": "2026-09-01",
                      "planned_end": "2027-06-30",
                      "site_manager": {
                        "full_name": "Karimov Anvar",
                        "phone": "+998901234567"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "spec_version": "1.0",
                    "event_id": "01928f3a-0000-7a00-8000-000000000003",
                    "event_type": "site.work_plan",
                    "occurred_at": "2026-10-01T09:05:00+05:00",
                    "source": {
                      "system": "buildops",
                      "system_version": "2.0.10"
                    },
                    "organization": {
                      "stir": "305123456"
                    },
                    "site_id": "obyekt-17",
                    "data": {
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "item_id": "wp-101",
                          "code": "E01-01-013",
                          "name": "Gruntni ekskavator bilan qazish",
                          "unit": "m3",
                          "planned_quantity": "4200"
                        },
                        {
                          "item_id": "wp-102",
                          "code": "E06-01-001",
                          "name": "Poydevorga beton quyish B25",
                          "unit": "m3",
                          "planned_quantity": "860.5"
                        },
                        {
                          "item_id": "wp-103",
                          "name": "G'isht terish",
                          "unit": "m3",
                          "planned_quantity": "1250"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "spec_version": "1.0",
                    "event_id": "01928f3a-0000-7a00-8000-000000000004",
                    "event_type": "site.daily_report",
                    "occurred_at": "2026-10-02T19:10:00+05:00",
                    "source": {
                      "system": "buildops",
                      "system_version": "2.0.10"
                    },
                    "organization": {
                      "stir": "305123456"
                    },
                    "site_id": "obyekt-17",
                    "data": {
                      "date": "2026-10-02",
                      "workforce": {
                        "present": 23,
                        "verified_present": 21
                      },
                      "equipment": [
                        {
                          "type": "Ekskavator",
                          "plate_number": "70A123BC",
                          "engine_hours": 7.5,
                          "source": "gps"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "Samosval",
                          "plate_number": "70B456CD",
                          "source": "manual"
                        }
                      ],
                      "work_done": [
                        {
                          "item_id": "wp-101",
                          "quantity": "310",
                          "unit": "m3"
                        },
                        {
                          "item_id": "wp-102",
                          "quantity": "45.5",
                          "unit": "m3"
                        }
                      ],
                      "quality": {
                        "status": "ok"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "To'plam qayta ishlandi.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BatchResult"
                },
                "example": {
                  "results": [
                    {
                      "event_id": "01928f3a-0000-7a00-8000-000000000001",
                      "index": 0,
                      "status": "duplicate"
                    },
                    {
                      "event_id": "01928f3a-0000-7a00-8000-000000000003",
                      "index": 1,
                      "status": "accepted"
                    },
                    {
                      "event_id": "01928f3a-0000-7a00-8000-000000000004",
                      "index": 2,
                      "status": "rejected",
                      "errors": [
                        {
                          "code": "unknown_site",
                          "path": "/site_id",
                          "message": "Obyekt hali site.profile bilan ro'yxatga olinmagan"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "413": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooLarge"
          },
          "429": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/RateLimited"
          },
          "503": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unavailable"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/media": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Fayllar"
        ],
        "operationId": "postMedia",
        "summary": "Rasm yuklash",
        "description": "Rasm fayli (≤ 10 MB) xom holda yuboriladi. Javobdagi `media_id`\n`site.photo` yoki `site.incident` hodisasida ishlatiladi. Bir xil fayl\nqayta yuklansa o'sha `media_id` qaytadi.\n",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "X-QMOS-Content-SHA256",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Fayl tanasining SHA-256 xeshi (hex, kichik harflar).",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "image/jpeg": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "contentMediaType": "image/jpeg"
              }
            },
            "image/png": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "contentMediaType": "image/png"
              }
            },
            "image/webp": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "contentMediaType": "image/webp"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Fayl saqlandi.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MediaResult"
                },
                "example": {
                  "media_id": "01928f3b-1111-7a00-8000-0000000000aa",
                  "sha256": "9f2c6d0f7a3b1e5c8d4a2b6e0f1c3d5e7a9b0c2d4e6f8a1b3c5d7e9f0a2b4c6d",
                  "size_bytes": 482113,
                  "content_type": "image/jpeg"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          },
          "413": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/TooLarge"
          },
          "415": {
            "description": "Fayl turi qo'llab-quvvatlanmaydi (faqat JPEG, PNG, WebP).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/ping": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Xizmat"
        ],
        "operationId": "ping",
        "summary": "Kalit va soatni tekshirish",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Kalit to'g'ri.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "additionalProperties": false,
                  "required": [
                    "organization_stir",
                    "server_time",
                    "spec_versions"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "organization_stir": {
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    "server_time": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "format": "date-time"
                    },
                    "spec_versions": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Unauthorized"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "qmosKeyId": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-QMOS-Key-Id"
      },
      "qmosTimestamp": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-QMOS-Timestamp"
      },
      "qmosSignature": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-QMOS-Signature",
        "description": "HMAC-SHA256 imzo — yuqoridagi \"Autentifikatsiya\" bo'limiga qarang."
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "BatchResult": {
        "title": "Hodisalar to'plami (javob)",
        "description": "Har bir yuborilgan hodisa uchun bitta natija, so'rovdagi tartibda. `accepted` va `duplicate` — yuboruvchi hodisani yuborilgan deb belgilaydi. `rejected` — qayta yuborish foydasiz, xatoni tuzatish kerak. `retry` — markaz vaqtincha qabul qila olmadi, keyinroq xuddi shu hodisani qayta yuborish kerak.",
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "results"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "results": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": [
                "event_id",
                "status"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "event_id": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "So'rovdagi event_id (u noto'g'ri bo'lsa ham, borligicha qaytariladi)."
                },
                "index": {
                  "type": "integer",
                  "minimum": 0,
                  "description": "Hodisaning so'rovdagi tartib raqami."
                },
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "accepted",
                    "duplicate",
                    "rejected",
                    "retry"
                  ]
                },
                "errors": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Batch": {
        "title": "Hodisalar to'plami (so'rov)",
        "description": "POST /v1/events so'rovi tanasi. Har bir hodisa ALOHIDA qabul qilinadi yoki rad etiladi — bittasining xatosi boshqalarini to'xtatmaydi.",
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "events"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "events": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 500,
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Event"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Common_uuid": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "uuid",
        "pattern": "^[0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}$",
        "description": "UUID (tavsiya: v7 — vaqt bo'yicha tartiblanadi)."
      },
      "Common_stir": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[0-9]{9}$",
        "description": "Tashkilotning STIR (INN) raqami — 9 ta raqam."
      },
      "Common_local_id": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "maxLength": 64,
        "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9._:-]+$",
        "description": "Yuboruvchi tizimdagi barqaror identifikator. Bir marta berilgach HECH QACHON o'zgarmaydi va qayta ishlatilmaydi."
      },
      "Common_date": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "date",
        "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$",
        "description": "Sana, YYYY-MM-DD. Mahalliy (Asia/Tashkent) kalendar bo'yicha."
      },
      "Common_datetime": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "date-time",
        "pattern": "^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}T[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2}(\\.[0-9]{1,6})?(Z|[+-][0-9]{2}:[0-9]{2})$",
        "description": "Vaqt, RFC 3339, vaqt zonasi bilan MAJBURIY (masalan 2026-10-05T09:30:00+05:00)."
      },
      "Common_quantity": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^(0|[1-9][0-9]{0,14})(\\.[0-9]{1,6})?$",
        "description": "Manfiy bo'lmagan o'nli son, MATN ko'rinishida (yaxlitlash xatosi bo'lmasligi uchun). Masalan \"45.5\"."
      },
      "Common_unit": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "maxLength": 20,
        "description": "O'lchov birligi. Tavsiya etilgan qiymatlar: m, m2, m3, t, kg, dona, km, l, kompl, soat."
      },
      "Common_text": {
        "type": "string",
        "minLength": 1,
        "maxLength": 2000
      },
      "Common_soato_region": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^17[0-9]{2}$",
        "description": "Viloyat (yoki Toshkent shahri / Qoraqalpog'iston Respublikasi) SOATO kodi — 4 raqam."
      },
      "Common_soato_district": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^17[0-9]{5}$",
        "description": "Tuman (shahar) SOATO kodi — 7 raqam. Birinchi 4 raqami viloyat kodiga teng bo'lishi shart."
      },
      "Common_coordinates": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "WGS84 koordinatalari. Chegaralar O'zbekiston hududini qamrab oladi.",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "lat",
          "lng"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "lat": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 37.0,
            "maximum": 46.0
          },
          "lng": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 55.0,
            "maximum": 74.0
          }
        }
      },
      "Common_organization_ref": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "name"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 300
          },
          "stir": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_stir"
          }
        }
      },
      "DailyReport": {
        "title": "site.daily_report — kunlik hisobot",
        "description": "Bitta obyektning bitta kundagi holati. Bir kun uchun qayta yuborilsa (yangi event_id, `supersedes` bilan) — markaz eng oxirgisini joriy deb oladi, eskisi tarixda saqlanadi. Ishchilar ISM-SHARIFI yuborilmaydi — faqat sonlar.",
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "date",
          "workforce",
          "equipment",
          "work_done"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "date": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_date"
          },
          "workforce": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "present"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "present": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 100000,
                "description": "Shu kuni obyektda ishlaganlar soni."
              },
              "verified_present": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 0,
                "maximum": 100000,
                "description": "Ulardan joylashuv (geofence) va/yoki surat bilan tasdiqlangan davomat orqali qayd etilganlari. Qo'lda kiritilgan son bilan farqi — ishonchlilik ko'rsatkichi."
              }
            }
          },
          "equipment": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 2000,
            "description": "Shu kuni obyektda ishlagan texnika. Bo'sh ro'yxat = texnika ishlamagan.",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": [
                "type",
                "source"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "type": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 100,
                  "description": "Texnika turi (Ekskavator, Samosval, Avtogreyder...)."
                },
                "plate_number": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 20,
                  "description": "Davlat raqami (bo'lsa)."
                },
                "engine_hours": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "minimum": 0,
                  "maximum": 24
                },
                "source": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "manual",
                    "gps"
                  ],
                  "description": "Ma'lumot manbai: qo'lda kiritilgan yoki GPS-treker."
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "work_done": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 5000,
            "description": "Shu kuni bajarilgan ish hajmlari. `item_id` — site.work_plan dagi qator.",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": [
                "item_id",
                "quantity",
                "unit"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "item_id": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_local_id"
                },
                "quantity": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_quantity"
                },
                "unit": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_unit"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "quality": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "status"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "ok",
                  "issue"
                ]
              },
              "note": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_text"
              }
            },
            "allOf": [
              {
                "if": {
                  "properties": {
                    "status": {
                      "const": "issue"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "then": {
                  "required": [
                    "note"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          "note": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_text"
          }
        }
      },
      "Error": {
        "title": "Xato",
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "code",
          "message"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "schema",
              "semantic",
              "unknown_site",
              "conflict",
              "supersedes_not_found",
              "media_not_found",
              "organization_mismatch",
              "unsupported_version",
              "auth",
              "payload_too_large",
              "rate_limited",
              "internal"
            ],
            "description": "schema — tuzilish xatosi; semantic — mazmun xatosi (masalan tuman kodi viloyatga mos emas); unknown_site — obyekt hali site.profile bilan ro'yxatga olinmagan; conflict — shu event_id boshqa mazmun bilan allaqachon kelgan; supersedes_not_found — tuzatilayotgan hodisa topilmadi; media_not_found — rasm yuklanmagan yoki sha256 mos emas; organization_mismatch — STIR API kaliti egasiga teng emas."
          },
          "path": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Xato joyi, JSON Pointer (masalan /data/address/district_soato)."
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "Event": {
        "title": "Hodisa (konvert)",
        "description": "Markazga yuboriladigan har bir xabar shu konvertda bo'ladi. `data` tarkibi `event_type` ga qarab belgilanadi. Hodisa markazda O'ZGARMAS saqlanadi: xatoni tuzatish uchun yangi hodisa yuboriladi va `supersedes` da eskisining `event_id` si ko'rsatiladi.",
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "spec_version",
          "event_id",
          "event_type",
          "occurred_at",
          "source",
          "organization",
          "site_id",
          "data"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "spec_version": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^1\\.[0-9]+$",
            "description": "Standart versiyasi (1.x). Markaz 1.x ning barcha kichik versiyalarini qabul qiladi."
          },
          "event_id": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_uuid",
            "description": "Hodisaning global noyob identifikatori. Takroriy yuborishda o'zgarmaydi (idempotentlik)."
          },
          "event_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "site.profile",
              "site.status",
              "site.work_plan",
              "site.daily_report",
              "site.photo",
              "site.incident"
            ]
          },
          "occurred_at": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_datetime",
            "description": "Hodisa yuboruvchi tizimda qayd etilgan vaqt."
          },
          "source": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "system",
              "system_version"
            ],
            "description": "Yuboruvchi dastur.",
            "properties": {
              "system": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{1,39}$",
                "description": "Dastur kodi (markazda ro'yxatdan o'tgan), masalan \"buildops\"."
              },
              "system_version": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 40
              }
            }
          },
          "organization": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "stir"
            ],
            "description": "Pudratchi tashkilot. STIR API kaliti egasiga teng bo'lishi shart.",
            "properties": {
              "stir": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_stir"
              }
            }
          },
          "site_id": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_local_id",
            "description": "Obyektning yuboruvchi tizimdagi identifikatori. Markazda obyekt (organization.stir, site_id) jufti bilan aniqlanadi."
          },
          "supersedes": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_uuid",
            "description": "Shu hodisa tuzatayotgan oldingi hodisa. U bilan bir xil event_type, organization va site_id bo'lishi shart."
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        "allOf": [
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "event_type": {
                  "const": "site.profile"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "event_type"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "data": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SiteProfile"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "event_type": {
                  "const": "site.status"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "event_type"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "data": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SiteStatus"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "event_type": {
                  "const": "site.work_plan"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "event_type"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "data": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WorkPlan"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "event_type": {
                  "const": "site.daily_report"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "event_type"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "data": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/DailyReport"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "event_type": {
                  "const": "site.photo"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "event_type"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "data": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Photo"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "event_type": {
                  "const": "site.incident"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "event_type"
              ]
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "data": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Incident"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "Incident": {
        "title": "site.incident — hodisa",
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "kind",
          "severity",
          "happened_at",
          "description"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "accident",
              "safety_violation",
              "work_stoppage",
              "material_shortage",
              "other"
            ],
            "description": "Baxtsiz hodisa, xavfsizlik qoidasi buzilishi, ish to'xtashi, material yetishmasligi, boshqa."
          },
          "severity": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "low",
              "medium",
              "high"
            ]
          },
          "happened_at": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_datetime"
          },
          "description": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_text"
          },
          "photo_media_ids": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 20,
            "uniqueItems": true,
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_uuid"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "MediaResult": {
        "title": "Yuklangan fayl",
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "media_id",
          "sha256",
          "size_bytes",
          "content_type"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "media_id": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_uuid"
          },
          "sha256": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
          },
          "size_bytes": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 10485760
          },
          "content_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "image/jpeg",
              "image/png",
              "image/webp"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "Photo": {
        "title": "site.photo — fotofiksatsiya",
        "description": "Obyektdan surat. Rasm faylining o'zi avval POST /v1/media orqali yuklanadi; bu hodisa unga `media_id` va `sha256` orqali havola qiladi (markaz ikkalasi mosligini tekshiradi).",
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "media_id",
          "sha256",
          "taken_at"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "media_id": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_uuid"
          },
          "sha256": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$"
          },
          "taken_at": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_datetime"
          },
          "location": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_coordinates",
            "description": "Suratga olingan joy (qurilma GPS'i)."
          },
          "caption": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 500
          }
        }
      },
      "SiteProfile": {
        "title": "site.profile — obyekt pasporti",
        "description": "Obyektning to'liq pasporti. Har safar TO'LIQ holati yuboriladi (qisman emas); markaz eng oxirgisini joriy deb oladi. Obyekt birinchi marta shu hodisa bilan ro'yxatga olinadi — boshqa hodisalar undan oldin kelsa rad etiladi.",
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "name",
          "category",
          "address",
          "location",
          "customer",
          "planned_start",
          "planned_end"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 300,
            "description": "Obyekt nomi."
          },
          "category": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "building_residential",
              "building_public",
              "building_industrial",
              "road",
              "bridge",
              "utility_network",
              "irrigation",
              "landscaping",
              "other"
            ],
            "description": "Obyekt turi: turar-joy binosi, ijtimoiy bino, sanoat binosi, yo'l, ko'prik, muhandislik tarmoqlari, irrigatsiya, obodonlashtirish, boshqa."
          },
          "address": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "region_soato",
              "district_soato"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "region_soato": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_soato_region"
              },
              "district_soato": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_soato_district"
              },
              "text": {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 500,
                "description": "Manzil matni (mahalla, ko'cha, mo'ljal)."
              }
            }
          },
          "location": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "center"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "center": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_coordinates"
              },
              "radius_m": {
                "type": "integer",
                "minimum": 10,
                "maximum": 20000,
                "description": "Obyekt hududi radiusi, metr."
              }
            }
          },
          "permit": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "number"
            ],
            "description": "Qurilishga ruxsatnoma. \"Shaffof qurilish\" tizimi bilan bog'lash shu orqali.",
            "properties": {
              "number": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 100
              },
              "issued_on": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_date"
              },
              "registry_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 100,
                "description": "\"Shaffof qurilish\" tizimidagi ariza/obyekt identifikatori (ma'lum bo'lsa)."
              }
            }
          },
          "customer": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_organization_ref",
            "description": "Buyurtmachi."
          },
          "funding_source": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "state_budget",
              "local_budget",
              "international",
              "private",
              "mixed"
            ],
            "description": "Moliyalashtirish manbai: respublika byudjeti, mahalliy byudjet, xalqaro moliya institutlari, xususiy, aralash."
          },
          "planned_start": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_date"
          },
          "planned_end": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_date"
          },
          "site_manager": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "full_name"
            ],
            "description": "Obyekt uchun mas'ul shaxs (prorab) — inspeksiya bog'lanishi uchun. Shaxsga doir ma'lumot: faqat shu ikki maydon.",
            "properties": {
              "full_name": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 200
              },
              "phone": {
                "type": "string",
                "pattern": "^\\+998[0-9]{9}$"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "SiteStatus": {
        "title": "site.status — obyekt holati o'zgardi",
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "status",
          "effective_on"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "planned",
              "active",
              "suspended",
              "completed",
              "cancelled"
            ],
            "description": "Rejalashtirilgan, ish olib borilmoqda, to'xtatilgan, yakunlangan, bekor qilingan."
          },
          "effective_on": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_date"
          },
          "reason": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_text",
            "description": "Sabab. To'xtatilgan va bekor qilingan holatlarda MAJBURIY."
          }
        },
        "allOf": [
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "status": {
                  "enum": [
                    "suspended",
                    "cancelled"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "required": [
                "reason"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "WorkPlan": {
        "title": "site.work_plan — rejalashtirilgan ish hajmlari",
        "description": "Obyekt bo'yicha FIZIK ish hajmlari rejasi (smeta qatorlari, narxsiz). Har safar to'liq ro'yxat yuboriladi va oldingisini almashtiradi. Bajarilish foizi shu reja va kunlik hisobotlardagi hajmlardan hisoblanadi.",
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "items"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "items": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 5000,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "required": [
                "item_id",
                "name",
                "unit",
                "planned_quantity"
              ],
              "properties": {
                "item_id": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_local_id"
                },
                "code": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "maxLength": 50,
                  "description": "Smeta/normativ kodi (bo'lsa)."
                },
                "name": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1,
                  "maxLength": 500
                },
                "unit": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_unit"
                },
                "planned_quantity": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Common_quantity"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorBody": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "errors"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "errors": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "responses": {
      "BadRequest": {
        "description": "So'rov tanasi JSON emas yoki to'plam tuzilishi noto'g'ri (masalan 500 tadan ortiq hodisa).",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Unauthorized": {
        "description": "Kalit noma'lum, imzo noto'g'ri yoki vaqt farqi 300 soniyadan katta.",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "TooLarge": {
        "description": "So'rov hajmi chegaradan katta (hodisalar — 5 MB, fayl — 10 MB).",
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "RateLimited": {
        "description": "Juda ko'p so'rov. `Retry-After` sarlavhasidagi soniyadan keyin qayta yuboring.",
        "headers": {
          "Retry-After": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        },
        "content": {
          "application/json": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorBody"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "Unavailable": {
        "description": "Markaz vaqtincha ishlamayapti. Butun to'plamni keyinroq qayta yuboring.",
        "headers": {
          "Retry-After": {
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
